# Privacy (GDPR-oriented)

Authoritative: `compliance/GDPR.md`, `compliance/DATA_INVENTORY.md`, `compliance/DATA_CLASSIFICATION.md`.

For features processing personal data, update the data inventory with purpose, categories, proposed legal basis (legal validation required), retention, recipients, and subject-rights impact.

Special care: GPS, location history, driver behavior, vehicle–user links, diagnostics tied to individuals, auth/device data.

- Anti-stalking: no unauthorized tracking; location not in logs/analytics/crash/blockchain by default.
- Account holder may not be the only data subject.
- DPIA screening per `compliance/DPIA_SCREENING.md` when triggers apply.

Legal bases and retention periods require **REQUIRES_HUMAN_LEGAL_REVIEW**.
